/// @assertion A type T is more specific than a type S, written T << S, if one
/// of the following conditions is met:
///  • T is S.
///  • T is ⊥
///  • S is dynamic.
///  • S is a direct supertype of T.
///  • T is a type parameter and S is the upper bound of T.
